I need music for work.
I take my phone.
But the battery is almost empty.
I need my charging cable.
Where is the charging cable?
It is not lying on the table.
It is also not lying next to the laptop.
I search in the bedroom.
Is the cable lying on the bed?
No, there is no cable lying there.
My backpack is lying on the floor.
I open the backpack.
A sweater is lying in the backpack.
The sweater is very thick.
I lift the sweater up.
There is the charging cable!
It is lying in the backpack, exactly under the sweater.
I take the cable and charge my phone.
Now I am finally listening to music.
